<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Dear {!Contact.FirstName},</span></font><br><br><div><font face="arial">Congratulations on your admission to <a href="http://havasu.asu.edu/">ASU Colleges at Lake Havasu City</a>. I look forward to welcoming you to ASU at Lake Havasu in fall 2016.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">In recognition of your hard work and your decision to live in the residence hall, you're being awarded a ${xxxx} <b>Housing Scholarship</b> to assist in the cost of housing.This award is only available for your first year residing in the residence hall and will not be renewable, and is granted in addition to any other financial aid you receive.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">In order for the Housing Scholarship to be applied to your account, you will need to confirm your intent to attend ASU Colleges at Lake Havasu City by paying the enrollment deposit of $300.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If you have questions, I encourage you to contact your admission counselor, Laura Shuffler, at <a href="https://asu.my.salesforce.com/email/author/ASULauraShuffler@asu.edu">ASULauraShuffler@asu.edu</a> or 928-854-9707, at your earliest convenience.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Welcome to ASU at Lake Havasu.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Go Devils!</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">David A. Young</font></div><div><font face="arial">Director</font></div><div><font face="arial">ASU Colleges at Lake Havasu City&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial" color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div><br>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>